1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,139
Dodo: Hi, little explorers! I'm Dodo!

2
00:00:08,289 --> 00:00:10,863
Dini: And I'm Dini! Dino-hello!

3
00:00:11,013 --> 00:00:15,543
Dodo: Welcome to the rainbow garden. But oh no! Everything is grey!

4
00:00:15,693 --> 00:00:17,659
Dini: Where did all the colors go?

5
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:21,999
Dodo: Let's find six colorful things and bring the colors back!

6
00:00:23,349 --> 00:00:25,470
Dini: Look! A blue apple!

7
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,746
Dodo: Not quite, Dini. This apple is red!

8
00:00:28,896 --> 00:00:31,005
Dodo: Red! Can you say red?

9
00:00:33,105 --> 00:00:35,786
Dini: Red! Red like a yummy apple!

10
00:00:35,936 --> 00:00:38,927
Dodo: Can you find something red near you?

11
00:00:42,627 --> 00:00:44,849
Dodo: What is floating up there?

12
00:00:44,999 --> 00:00:47,242
Dini: A balloon! Is it yellow?

13
00:00:47,392 --> 00:00:50,545
Dodo: No, silly! What color is the balloon?

14
00:00:52,645 --> 00:00:55,340
Dodo: It's blue! Blue like the sky!

15
00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:57,531
Dini: Blue! Dino-wow!

16
00:00:58,881 --> 00:01:02,008
Dini: Something is shining! Ooh, a green star!

17
00:01:02,158 --> 00:01:05,249
Dodo: Try again, Dini. The star is yellow!

18
00:01:05,399 --> 00:01:07,461
Dodo: Can you say yellow?

19
00:01:09,561 --> 00:01:12,316
Dini: Yellow! Yellow like the sunshine!

20
00:01:13,666 --> 00:01:15,480
Dodo: Look, a little leaf!

21
00:01:15,630 --> 00:01:17,154
Dini: Is it purple?

22
00:01:17,304 --> 00:01:20,438
Dodo: No, it's green! Just like you, Dini!

23
00:01:20,588 --> 00:01:22,994
Dini: Green like me! Hooray!

24
00:01:23,144 --> 00:01:25,580
Dodo: Which thing is green? The leaf!

25
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,977
Dini: Mmm, a round fruit! Is it red?

26
00:01:31,127 --> 00:01:35,159
Dodo: Close! This is an orange, and its color is orange too!

27
00:01:35,309 --> 00:01:36,828
Dodo: Say orange!

28
00:01:38,928 --> 00:01:41,707
Dini: Orange! Like your sneakers, Dodo!

29
00:01:43,057 --> 00:01:45,487
Dodo: One more color to find!

30
00:01:45,637 --> 00:01:48,328
Dini: A pretty flower! Is it blue?

31
00:01:48,478 --> 00:01:51,423
Dodo: Almost! This flower is purple!

32
00:01:51,573 --> 00:01:53,794
Dodo: Can you say purple?

33
00:01:55,894 --> 00:01:58,348
Dini: Purple! I love purple!

34
00:01:59,698 --> 00:02:03,052
Dodo: We found all six colors! Look at the garden!

35
00:02:03,202 --> 00:02:05,821
Dini: The rainbow is back! Hooray!

36
00:02:07,171 --> 00:02:11,438
Dodo: Let's play a color game! I show a thing, you shout the color!

37
00:02:11,588 --> 00:02:13,455
Dodo: What color is this?

38
00:02:15,355 --> 00:02:16,350
Dini: Blue!

39
00:02:16,650 --> 00:02:18,518
Dodo: What color is this?

40
00:02:20,418 --> 00:02:21,444
Dini: Red!

41
00:02:21,744 --> 00:02:23,612
Dodo: What color is this?

42
00:02:25,512 --> 00:02:26,580
Dini: Green!

43
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,747
Dodo: What color is this?

44
00:02:30,647 --> 00:02:31,826
Dini: Purple!

45
00:02:32,126 --> 00:02:33,994
Dodo: What color is this?

46
00:02:35,894 --> 00:02:36,946
Dini: Yellow!

47
00:02:37,246 --> 00:02:39,113
Dodo: What color is this?

48
00:02:41,013 --> 00:02:41,985
Dini: Orange!

49
00:02:43,485 --> 00:02:46,404
Dodo: Can you remember all six colors?

50
00:02:48,704 --> 00:02:52,334
Dodo: Wow! We learned six beautiful colors today!

51
00:02:52,484 --> 00:02:56,186
Dini: Red, blue, yellow, green, orange and purple! Dino-wow!

52
00:02:56,336 --> 00:02:59,724
Dodo: Share this video with a friend who loves colors!

53
00:02:59,874 --> 00:03:02,975
Dodo & Dini: See you next time, little explorers!

